# 🧩 Step 3 — Build the generator logic (core magic)
 
This is VERY simple rule-based mapping.
 
## 1. Calculate progress state
 
```javascript
progress = saved / goal
 
if (progress <= 0.2) stage = 1
else if (progress <= 0.4) stage = 2
else if (progress <= 0.6) stage = 3
else if (progress <= 0.8) stage = 4
else stage = 5
```
 
For MVP:
👉 fake “saved” amount (e.g. 35%) OR let user input it
 
---
 
## 2. Map visual
 
```javascript
if (style === "plant") show plant_stage_3.svg
if (style === "jar") show jar_stage_3.svg
if (style === "build") show build_stage_3.svg
```
 
---
 
## 3. Map icon
 
```javascript
if (goal === "travel") icon = plane.svg
```
 
---
 
## 4. Generate milestones
 
Simple rule:
 
```javascript
milestones = [
  goal * 0.25,
  goal * 0.5,
  goal * 0.75,
  goal
]
```
 
---
 
## 5. Generate message
 
```javascript
if (progress < 0.3)
  msg = "You're just getting started — momentum builds quickly."
else if (progress < 0.7)
  msg = "You're making steady progress. Keep going."
else
  msg = "You're close — final stretch!"
```
 
